    "scenesThatPass": [
      "THEO: You may think I have a sickness about packing, but asking people to help me shlep the stuff I take with me everywhere is a cheap and exploit…\nNELL: I'm Eleanor but everyone calls me Nell. Eleanor Vance. Nell. I'm really glad you're here. Really.\nNELL: What a beautiful jacket.\nTHEO: And what you're wearing, that's great, too.",
