      "THEO: Here. Here. Here. Oh yes! Oh yes oh YES! Here!\nTHEO: Can't you just see it?\nNELL: Theo!",
      "NELL: I love this house. I really love this house.\nTHEO: You're okay.",
      "THEO: No, but Nell's been here longer than I have.\nNELL: I only saw Theo drive up."
    ]
